  "text": "Fixed the layout issue in the Elecciones2026 project where \"Fórmula Presidencial\" was appearing at the bottom of the page after all platform accordions. The fix involved:\n\n1. Removed the compact running mates section from inside the Candidatos accordion in PartyPlatform.tsx (lines 210-229)\n2. Added the detailed Fórmula Presidencial section to PartyPlatform.tsx, right after the Candidatos section\n3. Removed the duplicate Fórmula Presidencial section from page.tsx (lines 267-302)\n\nThe root cause was that the Fórmula Presidencial was rendered in page.tsx AFTER the entire PartyPlatform component, rather than being part of the component's internal layout. Now it appears immediately after Candidatos, before all the platform accordions.",
  "sections": [
    "Project Notes"
  ],
